		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a willing creature</p><hr><p>The jagged edges of this rune evoke the claws and talons of mighty beasts. The target's nose becomes an animal-like snout, giving the rune-bearer scent as an imprecise scent with a range of 30 feet.</p><p><strong>Invocation </strong>The rune-bearer's muscles bulge with the strength of a ferocious beast. The bearer can immediately Step as a free action. The next unarmed Strike the bearer attempts before the start of your next turn deals an additional die of damage.</p>"
